  "quranAyahInsightPathTitleSignsInCreationStarter": "Signs in Creation Starter",
  "quranAyahInsightPathDescriptionSignsInCreationStarter": "A calm introduction to the sky, time, rain, and living signs that call the heart to reflection.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathReflectionSignsInCreationStarter": "Notice how repeated signs in the created world invite both wonder and gratitude instead of passing attention.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathTitleWorshipRemembranceStarter": "Worship & Remembrance Starter",
  "quranAyahInsightPathDescriptionWorshipRemembranceStarter": "A practical sequence on prayer, dhikr, du''a, sincerity, and reliance on Allah.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathReflectionWorshipRemembranceStarter": "Move through these ayahs by asking how remembrance should shape your actual day, not only your thoughts.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathTitleCharacterAdabStarter": "Character & Adab Starter",
  "quranAyahInsightPathDescriptionCharacterAdabStarter": "A guided sequence on patience, mercy, justice, forgiveness, and good conduct with people.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathReflectionCharacterAdabStarter": "Read each step as a behavior check: what should change in speech, restraint, fairness, or treatment of others?",
  "quranAyahInsightPathTitleTawhidBeliefStarter": "Tawhid & Belief Starter",
  "quranAyahInsightPathDescriptionTawhidBeliefStarter": "A foundational path through oneness, signs, trust, rejection of shirk, and living with taqwa.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathReflectionTawhidBeliefStarter": "Keep asking how sound belief changes reliance, sincerity, and the way you read the signs around you.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathTitleAkhirahAccountabilityStarter": "Akhirah & Accountability Starter",
  "quranAyahInsightPathDescriptionAkhirahAccountabilityStarter": "A balanced path through judgment, deeds, resurrection, urgency, and hope in the Hereafter.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathReflectionAkhirahAccountabilityStarter": "Let each ayah move you toward preparation, not fear alone: deeds, honesty, urgency, and hope all belong here.",
